# Local secrets for `pnpm pages:dev` (wrangler reads `.dev.vars`, which is
# gitignored). Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in your key:
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# Create a key in the Dragoneye Playground: https://playground.dragoneye.ai/account
# In production, set this as an encrypted environment variable in the Cloudflare
# Pages dashboard instead. NEVER prefix it with VITE_ — that would ship it to the
# browser bundle. It is only ever read server-side by functions/api/scan.ts.
DRAGONEYE_API_KEY=your_dragoneye_api_key_here
